<section id="story" class="bg-cream py-20 text-ink lg:py-28">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <h2 class="h2 lg:col-span-5">A room that fills up slowly</h2>
    <div class="max-w-xl space-y-5 text-lg lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
      <p>
        The shop used to sell fabric. We kept the long cutting table, took out the shelves, and put the coffee
        machine where the sewing counter was.
      </p>
      <p>
        Cold brew steeps for twelve hours overnight. Pastries come out of the oven around eight and rarely
        last past the afternoon. Nobody here will ask you to move your laptop, and nobody will mind if you
        just sit.
      </p>
      <p class="border-l-4 border-ink pl-5 font-display text-3xl leading-tight">
        If you came to work, stay. If you came to do nothing, stay longer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
